flowchart LR
    Caller[Caller: popover Mis POI, etc.] --> Start["startOperation({operationId,<br/>label, source, blockReentry,<br/>safetyTimeoutMs})"]
    Start --> Check{blockReentry y op viva?}
    Check -->|sí| ReturnFalse[return false → caller aborta]
    Check -->|no| Pending[op = pending]

    Pending --> Watchdog["setTimeout safetyTimeoutMs<br/>(filter/subset-fit: 10s,<br/>render: 15s)"]

    Pending --> Run{markRunning ?}
    Run -->|sí| Running[op = running]
    Pending --> Progress{setProgress ?}
    Progress -->|sí| RunningP["op = running<br/>indeterminate=false<br/>progress + etaMs"]

    Running --> End{finishOperation o failOperation}
    RunningP --> End
    Pending --> End

    End -->|finish| Done[op = done]
    End -->|fail| Error[op = error]

    Watchdog -->|expira si pending/running| ForceFail[failOperation con safetyMessage]
    ForceFail --> Error

    Done --> Purge1[setTimeout 1500ms → delete op]
    Error --> Purge2[setTimeout 4000ms → delete op]

    UI[useActiveHeavyOperations] -.->|select ops| Store[(useHeavyOpsStore)]
    Pending -.-> Store
    Running -.-> Store
    Done -.-> Store
    Error -.-> Store
